WEBVTT

00:04:59.292 --> 00:05:01.851
Kwa wimbo huu, naomba wote tuchukue dakika moja

00:05:01.875 --> 00:05:04.476
na kutafakari kuhusu jamii ya wahamiaji,

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.684
na hususani jamii ya wakimbizi,

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:10.434
na magumu ya kila siku ambayo wanahitajika kupitia,

00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:12.434
kujenga maisha kwa heshima na maana

00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:15.559
mbali kutoka katika yote waliyoyapenda na kuyafahamu.

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:18.226
Kama unahisi huruma kwa wazo hili,

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.559
Naomba nione kiganja chako hewani pamoja nami.

00:05:20.583 --> 00:05:22.268
(Muziki)

00:05:22.292 --> 00:05:23.542
"Sauti milioni."

00:05:24.708 --> 00:05:27.726
Watu wanapaza sauti

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:31.059
Na sauti milioni